# 1. Entomogamous species

## 1.1. Temporality and field conditions

```{r}
m0 <- lmer(entomogame_1 ~ annee + JulianDay^2 + RisqueDebordement + exposition2 + TypeCulture  + (1| id_parcelle) , data=dataset_500_ENI_Lea, REML=F,na.action="na.fail")
summary(m0)
Anova(m0)
r.squaredGLMM(m0)
```

## 1.2. Production type

```{r}
